## Interface: 16001
## Title: Pathwise Insights
## Notes: Your leveling numbers in WoW: Forever, for every character: time, XP an hour, quests, kills, records, when you play, and a heat map of where you went. Works on its own; with Pathwise it also times each guide step. Kept on your computer.
